          <li><a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=51992005096&text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20contactarme%20para%20recibir%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20asesor%C3%ADa%20en%20tesis%20universitaria%20en%20Per%C3%BA.%20Vengo%20de%20tesis-ia.com&type=phone_number&app_absent=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300">WhatsApp +51 992 005 096</a></li>
